            "created_at": "2025-08-21T13:27:31.172314+00:00",
            "notes": "Have fun.\n\nAt this point you're likely facing a DVA, JQ, Zarya or Zenyatta and/or Kiriko, in some formation. Perhaps even a Rein.\n\nGood luck. \n\n--- This build is as far as you'll get without teamwork.\n\nCo-ordinate or follow dive mechanics with Genji and hope or direct one of your DPS to pull attention with a support. \n\nEach of your supports and each of your DPS should be pocketing one another in pairs, trading off if/when needed, with You in the middle somewhere.\n\nThis WILL and can ONLY change if one support is able to full team heal whilst the other focuses pocket damage AND support, in this scenario you would likely have 1 support pocketing the DPS together, whilst You and a support dive.\n\nGenji can also be Freya or Junkrat or Mei or Reaper.\n\nCass can also be Ashe or Soldier or Freya. Or Even Mei.\n\nJuno can be Kiriko or Lucio or Zenyatta. Or even Ana.\n\nMercy can be Kiriko or Juno or Ana.\n\nYou'll want anything besides a Lucio, Moira, Reaper combo. \n\nAll of them, and even You, fill the same \"bait and murder\" role. Other characters also can do this but are not primary fillers of this role.\n\nHaving one or another is just fine, but all at the same time forces supports to have to be close to the Tank if somebody is not pulling attention opposite of You, the Tank.\n\nThe only time Lucio, Rein, Reaper, Moira works- is if everybody in the match has that perfect flow, or all of You are in a 5 stack, regardless, (unless you are running a \"bee-hive\" playstyle), it is too easy to leave that/your other DPS out of play too often, crumbling the team in current Stadium dynamics.",
